  "description": "WUWSEP crystallizes in the cubic crystal system with space group P 21 3. Reported CIF formula moiety: C75 H72 Cu3 N9 O20 Tb3 4+,2(Cl1 O4 1-),2(H1 O1 1-),8(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Cu1 (Cu) has 3 O neighbors; Tb1F (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Cu1F (Cu) has 3 O neighbors; Tb1I (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Cu1I (Cu) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.461-3.858 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 102.93-110.09°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Cu3Tb3(O2)L3(PyCO2)3](OH)2(ClO4)2·8H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
